g depreciation has been changed to Straight Line Method from Written down value Method for the Financial Year 2020-21 and onwards.\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd The rationale behind the change of depreciation method is to align with the change in Company s expectation of the pattern of consumption of the economic benefits arising from these assets in future as against the past.\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd Effective 1 April 2020, method of providing depreciation and amortization for Property, Plant & Equipment and Intangible Assets by the Company has been changed to Straight Line Method from Written Down Value Method.\ufffd\ufffdThis is for your information and record.Thanking You,", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Updates", "difference": "00:13:42", "dt": "23062021162732", "exchdisstime": "23-Jun-2021 16:41:14", "fileSize": "-", "hasXbrl": false, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "104964081", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE00SZ01018", "sm_name": "Marshall Machines Limited", "sort_date": "2021-06-23 16:27:32", "symbol": "MARSHALL"}, {"an_dt": "23-Jun-2021 16:20:18", "attFileSize": null, "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MARSHALL_23062021162018_Outcome_BM_23_06_2021.pdf", "attchmntText": "Marshall Machines Limited has informed the Exchange regarding Board meeting held on Jun 23, 2021.\ufffd\ufffdIn continuation to notice dated 16.06.2021, we wish to inform you that Board of Directors in its meeting held today the Wednesday, the 23rd day of June 2021 the board meeting commenced at 03:00 P.M. and concluded at 04:00 P.M., inter alia, considered and approved the following:\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd\ufffd Method of providing depreciation has been changed to Straight Line Method from Written down value Method for the Financial Year 2020-21 and onwards.\ufff